    // Jacobi sweep schedules
    // -------------------------
    // We:
    //  - restrict k to the known interior extent [0, n-2),
    //  - tile k for coarse-grain parallelism,
    //  - vectorize the innermost loop using the natural vector width.
    Target target = get_host_target();
